			<tr><th id="4">028. カノポス壺</th></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/kodaibunmei2_014.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/kodaibunmei2_014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/collectclub/kodaibunmei2/img/kodaibunmei2_014.jpg" --></a><a href="img/kodaibunmei2_015.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/kodaibunmei2_015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/collectclub/kodaibunmei2/img/kodaibunmei2_015.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">
				ミイラづくりの際に、取り出された臓器を入れるカノポス壺。<br />
				そしてそれを収めた箱。</td></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/kodaibunmei2_016.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/kodaibunmei2_016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/collectclub/kodaibunmei2/img/kodaibunmei2_016.jpg" --></a><a href="img/kodaibunmei2_017.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/kodaibunmei2_017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/collectclub/kodaibunmei2/img/kodaibunmei2_017.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">
